flowchart LR
  user((读者))
  bar[阅读器底栏<br/>ReaderChapterControls]
  fav_btn[收藏按钮<br/>ReaderFavoriteButton]
  login[登录弹窗<br/>LoginDialog]
  user_store[(登录状态<br/>useUserStore)]
  detail[详情页<br/>ComicDetailView]
  fav_hook[收藏 hook<br/>useComicFavorite]
  cache[(详情缓存 阅读器与详情页共享<br/>queryKeys.comicDetail)]
  rust[收藏命令<br/>toggle_comic_favorite]
  jm[(JM API<br/>POST /favorite)]

  user -->|点击屏幕呼出| bar
  bar -->|渲染| fav_btn
  user -->|点击收藏| fav_btn
  fav_btn -->|读 user| user_store
  fav_btn -->|未登录时打开| login
  login -->|登录写入| user_store
  fav_btn -->|toggle| fav_hook
  detail -->|toggle| fav_hook
  fav_hook -->|写回 isFavorite| cache
  bar -.->|经 useReaderChapterInfo 读 isFavorite| cache
  fav_hook -->|invoke| rust
  rust -->|HTTP 切换收藏| jm

